{
  "text": "QR ADMIN\nBranch\nAll restaurant\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nUI Audit Second Branch A\nSign out\nBrowse workspace\nQR ORDERING / ADVANCED CONFIGURATION\nPickup Scheduling\n\nOffer takeaway slots that respect your branch hours and kitchen capacity.\n\nEnabled\nPickup scheduling\nEnable scheduled takeaway pickup\nAllow ASAP takeaway\n\nAvailable on menu-only QR codes for takeaway. Table QR orders stay dine-in. Times use the restaurant timezone and also respect ordering hours. Pending online orders reserve capacity until safely cancelled; payment failures never free a slot while a payment could still succeed.\n\nMinimum preparation lead (minutes)\nBooking cutoff (minutes)\nSlot interval (minutes)\nOrders per slot\nBooking horizon (days)\nPickup hours\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nSun\nMon\nTue\nWed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nRemove\nAdd hours\nClosed dates (one YYYY-MM-DD per line)\nPickup instructions\nSave settings",
